---
    title: Tomato Dal
    note: Should be less runny than the other toor dal.
---

Optionally, soak @toor dal{1/2%cup} in water for ~{30%minutes}, then discard soaking water.

Rinse the dal four times and drain.

Add @water{3/2%cup} to the pressure cooker along with the dal.

Add a pinch each of @jeera{}, @hing{}, @salt{}, @haldi{}, and @laal mirchi{}.

Chop @tomato{1%pc} and add it in.

Pressure cook for ~{4%whistles}.

Let the pressure cooker cool down fully before opening. until pressure released

Stir in @ghee{1%tbsp} and serve.
